lore:
Ding-a-ling, ding-a-ling, the baby is weeping;
Ding-a-ling, ding-a-ling, the infant is shrieking.
Ding-a-ling, ding-a-ling, the child is wailing;
Ding-a-ling, ding-a-ling, it hungers, you see.

